[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0010","text":"嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0020","text":"好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0030","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0040","text":"果穗，集合时间定下来了——哦\n抱歉，打扰你了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0050","text":"没有！\n我正好要结束了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0060","text":"学校的资料……不对，\n是信吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0070","text":"是的！\n我在给会长先生写信！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0080","text":"我试着想了想\n“如果是我，会想怎么做”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0090","text":"哦……\n是为了树里能做些什么的话题吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0100","text":"是的！\n我试着想了如果我是树里酱会怎样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0110","text":"会长先生的“决心”是改变不了的！\n所以，我想给他加油……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0120","text":"因为那是会长先生决定要“加油干！”的事，\n所以想说“加油”……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0130","text":"我可是偶像……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0140","text":"嗯……是啊\n是偶像嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0150","text":"我觉得这是个非常好的主意"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0160","text":"真的吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0170","text":"嗯\n如果是我，会非常高兴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0180","text":"所以，\n会长先生一定会开心的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03090000_03_0181","text":"Motion"}]
